# Live MCP catalog

Cursor may cache this server's instructions, tool descriptions, and prompt text
across MCP reconnects. Resource reads are live.

- After restart or before an investigation, read the matching policy URI from
  the MCP server (`policy://disputes/unrecognized-transaction`,
  `policy://fees/foreign-transaction`, or `policy://fees/late-payment`).
- Apply the live JSON. If cached instructions disagree, follow the resource.
- Unrecognized policy is fresh only when `version` is `1.2` and
  `post_synthesis.likely_duplicate` asks whether the customer contacted the
  merchant.
- Do not invent confirmation tokens or treat `approved=true` as proof.
